
Hitmap EXAMPLE
This program calculates the stable position of a spring system. There are CSR
and Bitmap structure versions. It reads a input graph and calculates the
final position after a given number of iterations.


spring_csr_sec.c			Sequential CSR version
spring_bitmap_sec.c			Sequential Bitmap version

spring_csr.c				Parallel CSR version (with Metis layout)
spring_csr_rows.c			Parallel CSR version (with row partition layout)

spring_bitmap.c				Parallel Bitmap version
spring_bitmap_iterdense.c	Bitmap version with an iterator that performs a dense loop.
spring_bitmap_iterskip.c	Bitmap version with an iterator that skips the empty elements.

check:						Script to execute a test of the program

